1
00:00:00,144 --> 00:00:01,714
(knocking)
Amy.

2
00:00:01,712 --> 00:00:02,982
(knocking)
Amy?

3
00:00:04,048 --> 00:00:06,078
(Amy:)That's Sheldon.

4
00:00:06,083 --> 00:00:08,183
You're kidding!
How's my hair?

5
00:00:13,991 --> 00:00:16,391
Sheldon, this-this isn't
a good time.

6
00:00:16,393 --> 00:00:17,963
(Sheldon:)I don't care.

7
00:00:17,962 --> 00:00:20,532
(Sheldon:)Amy, there was a song I
couldn't get out of my head.

8
00:00:20,531 --> 00:00:23,731
(Sheldon:)Eventually, I realized
the song was about you,

9
00:00:23,734 --> 00:00:28,434
(Sheldon:)and like that earworm, I can't
get you out of my heart.

10
00:00:28,439 --> 00:00:31,209
(Sheldon:)So, what I'm trying to say is,

11
00:00:31,208 --> 00:00:34,278
(Sheldon:)you're my heartworm.

12
00:00:35,446 --> 00:00:39,816
The metaphorical kind, not-not
the poodle-killing kind.

13
00:00:39,817 --> 00:00:42,017
W-W-W-What?

14
00:00:42,019 --> 00:00:44,089
(Dave:)If I may...

15
00:00:44,088 --> 00:00:46,218
(Dave:)I believe
what he's saying,

16
00:00:46,223 --> 00:00:47,993
(Dave:)in a charming
and delightful way,

17
00:00:47,992 --> 00:00:49,992
(Dave:)is that he loves you
and wants you back.

18
00:00:49,994 --> 00:00:51,524
(Dave:)Dave Gibbs,
huge fan of your work.

19
00:00:51,529 --> 00:00:53,359
(Dave:)Oh.
Don't mind me.

20
00:00:56,567 --> 00:00:59,697
I'm-I'm sorry; I didn't
realize you were on a date.

21
00:00:59,703 --> 00:01:02,433
No, it-it... it's okay.
Keep going?

